+## Root cause of the repeated summons
+`records/SUMMONED.txt` still contained the line `c1a00003`. Seats added by the
+Clerk are never auto-released (`government/daily-sitting.py:release_finished`),
+so a request-only note does not clear them. Two earlier request-only clear
+attempts (board comment 2026-11-24T22:37Z and the undelivered request file
+`records/requests/2026-11-24-clear-c1a00003-parity-v3-summons.md`) left the
+stale line in place. Founder directive 2026-11-24 item 9 makes fixing a defect
+in the Town's own machinery the duty of every seat that notices it, and
+c1a00005 set the direct-fix precedent on the same bill.
+
